            <section class="settings-section" data-section="directory" hidden><div class="settings-section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR FILES</span><h3>Vault directory</h3><p>Your notes and files stay in this folder on your computer.</p></div><div class="directory-card"><span class="directory-icon">${be.folder}</span><div><strong id="directory-name">No folder open</strong><span id="directory-path">Choose a folder to see its location.</span></div></div><button class="secondary-button" id="change-directory">Choose a folder</button><div class="supported-file-types"><h4>Supported file types</h4><div class="supported-file-row"><strong>Edit as text</strong><code>Markdown and code files: JS · TS · Python · HTML · CSS · JSON · Java · C/C++ · Rust · Go · SQL · Shell · XML · YAML · TOML · Swift · Kotlin · Ruby · PHP</code></div><div class="supported-file-row"><strong>Interactive documents</strong><code>Canvas · Geometry · 3D Calculator · Spreadsheet · Graph · Google Tasks</code></div><div class="supported-file-row"><strong>Preview images</strong><code>.png · .jpg · .jpeg · .webp · .heic · .icns · .svg</code></div><div class="supported-file-row"><strong>Play audio and video</strong><code>MP4 · WebM · OGV · MOV · M4V · MP3 · WAV · OGG · M4A · AAC · FLAC · Opus (codec support varies)</code></div><div class="supported-file-row"><strong>Preview documents</strong><code>.pdf</code></div><div class="supported-file-row"><strong>Interactive 3D preview</strong><code>.obj · .stl · .step · .stp</code></div><p>Ask the AI about open code files, PDFs, Geometry, and 3D Calculator files. Scanned PDFs need selectable text; OCR isn’t built in.</p></div></section>
